      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔌 SM-04 · Market brief API\nThe Vercel dashboard calls `GET /webhook/market-brief` with header `X-Brief-Secret`. It runs SM-02, SM-01 and SM-03 in \"return\" mode (nothing is sent to Telegram) and answers with the three briefs as JSON.\n\n**Setup:** credential **Market brief secret** (Header Auth, name `X-Brief-Secret`, value = the same secret as `BRIEF_SECRET` on Vercel). Each call costs ~30 FMP calls, so the Vercel side caches for 6 hours.",
